{
  "kind": "floret.patch",
  "version": 4,
  "appVersion": "0.0.1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Webcam Mosaic",
    "createdAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wm_doc",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "WEBCAM MOSAIC — how it works\n\nA live halftone of the camera. The frame is read once, sampled on a grid, and each cell becomes a YELLOW CIRCLE (where the image is light) or a BLUE SQUARE (where it is dark).\n\n①→② Read the feed · ③ Lay out a grid · ④ Per cell decide a shape · ⑤ Render",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "WEBCAM MOSAIC — how it works\n\nA live halftone of the camera. The frame is read once, sampled on a grid, and each cell becomes a YELLOW CIRCLE (where the image is light) or a BLUE SQUARE (where it is dark).\n\n①→② Read the feed · ③ Lay out a grid · ④ Per cell decide a shape · ⑤ Render",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wm_n_src",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 624,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "① LIVE SOURCE\nThe Toggle opens the camera (start). image/resize squares the feed to 500×500 so grid coords line up with pixels 1:1.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 120
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "① LIVE SOURCE\nThe Toggle opens the camera (start). image/resize squares the feed to 500×500 so grid coords line up with pixels 1:1.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wm_n_grid",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 1108,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "② GRID + ONE READ\nOne 36×36 grid, centred: its points place the shapes, and image/sample-spread reads the frame at the same points (sampling is centred like the canvas) — the whole frame ONCE → one colour per cell (fast).",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 140
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "② GRID + ONE READ\nOne 36×36 grid, centred: its points place the shapes, and image/sample-spread reads the frame at the same points (sampling is centred like the canvas) — the whole frame ONCE → one colour per cell (fast).",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 140
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wm_n_render",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 1612,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "⑤ RENDER\nThe ForEach hands back one chosen shape per cell; the Renderer draws them all into the live mosaic.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 120
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "⑤ RENDER\nThe ForEach hands back one chosen shape per cell; the Renderer draws them all into the live mosaic.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 120
      }
    },
